    "remedy_1": {
      "id": "remedy_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's repair this one.\n\nAveraging 25% and −10% gives 7.5%, but the two percentage bases are ₹800 and ₹1200, so a simple average is wrong.\n\nTotal S.P. = 1000 + 1080 = ₹2080. Profit = ₹80 on ₹2000 = 4%.\n\nNow use the same idea with fresh values.",
